ery little, to a final +3.9 and a 4-point win for the 12k."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "libs.py parses a pasted board and prints each group's stones and liberty count with a danger flag, and count.py removes the named dead stones and counts stones plus enclosed territory on the current position. Both only inspect the current position, with no candidate moves tried and no look-ahead.", "stop": false}}